"при обработке output, напротив, может завершить действие с ошибкой даже "
"после успешного ``execute``."
msgstr "If required data is missing, the output service may log an error and skip sending without changing the action to ``ERROR``. Conversely, an output processing exception may fail the action even after ``execute`` succeeds."

